on to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/islam">Islam</a> then accelerates</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1969</span><span class="rf-text">The funeral rites of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/serer">Serer</a> kings are last performed after the death of Maad a Sinig Mahecor Joof, the last king of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-sine">Sine</a></span></li></ol>
